# reserve-quorum — a reservation to a QUORUM target (m distinct of a set). The
# observation records the quorum target verbatim on `by`; the verdict is `reserved`
# (the m-of-n distinctness is enforced by the implementation's approval layer, not the
# language — the language fixes the target, the deployer enforces the count).
actor a
gate decide risk high grant a
reserve loans by 2 of { legal, finance }
cord a -> decide
cord decide -> master
